    "body": "Hey Joseos123 👋 \r\nLooking into oh-my-posh's behavior, it seems they achieve right-prompt support on shells that don't expose right-prompt themselves by using ANSI escape codes to move the cursor, print the right-prompt, and restore the cursor position.\r\n\r\nOur right-prompt implementation may need some adapting to accommodate fully cross-shell right-prompt support, but I think that's a good direction for the project.\r\n\r\nI'll update this issue to involve implementing right-prompt on all shells that don't implement it themselves, as it should, in theory, be possible with one single solution.",
